   }
   ```

   This works because:
   - If names are identical up to NUL, the NUL and padding match → equal
   - If they differ at some position before NUL, that's the comparison point
   - If one is a prefix of the other, the shorter one has NUL (0) at that position while the longer has a non-zero char → shorter sorts first

